e":"民惭惧，率妻子舂所取稻得六十斛米，送还牧。牧闭门不受；民输置道旁，莫有取者。牧由此发名","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":385,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-4abfeef38674616e60c6","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-4b9555645fd80f750476","layer":"original","quote":"赤乌五年，从郎中补太子辅义都尉〖1〗。迁南海太守。﹝一﹞还为丞相长史〖2〗。转司直〖3〗。迁中书令","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":398,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-55a68abe402d9a9107bc","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-53f50d8a3e0bf232cd15","layer":"original","quote":"乃以牧为平魏将军〖6〗，领武陵太守，往之郡","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":30,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-58d838412166414edab0","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-1017a8c1da2e3cef2cf5","layer":"pei","quote":"始兴太守羊衜，与太常滕胤书曰：‘钟离子幹，吾昔知之不熟；定见其在南海，威恩部伍，智勇分明；加操行清纯，有古人之风","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":424,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43dc051269e0fb8c25a0","start":96,"end":152,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-596cbbf52fad329b7367","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-7bdcab2ebb40d42ee681","layer":"pei","quote":"牧之在濡须，深以进取可图，而不敢陈其策；与侍中、东观令朱育宴，慨然叹息","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-33595db1c58d43d13067","start":12,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-5c665dad4ebc5ae6f679","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-baa8b50de45a43d8f054","layer":"original","quote":"会建安、鄱阳、新都三郡山民作乱，出牧为监军使者，讨平之。贼帅黄乱、常俱等，出其部伍〖4〗，以充兵役","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":399,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-6aa6c6f2a54821529153","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-08aa3315eec1e30f8b1c","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：山越好为叛乱，难安易动；是以孙权不遑外御，卑词魏氏〖1〗。凡此诸臣，皆克宁内难，绥静邦域者也。吕岱清恪在公。周鲂谲略多奇。钟离牧蹈长者之规。全琮有当世之才〖2〗，贵重于时；然不检奸子〖3〗，获讥毁名云","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":427,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-7679d2a939cb3e9dd26b","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-b311da2f13974b621922","layer":"original","quote":"非常之事，何得循旧！”即率所领，晨夜进道；缘山险行，垂二千里。从塞上〖16〗，斩恶民怀异心者魁帅百余人，及其支党凡千余级〖17〗；纯等散，五溪平","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":402,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":87,"end":159,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-7b310d8487c5ed8839c9","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-2fa89c10c678cbb2a783","layer":"original","quote":"迁公安督，扬武将军，封都乡侯。徙濡须督。﹝二﹞复以前将军，假节，领武陵太守","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-895aacea6678166ed35b","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-cd008264a5a2d2621e3e","layer":"pei","quote":"牧蹈长者之规。问者曰：‘如牧所行：犯而不校，又从而救之；直而不有，又还而不受。可不谓之仁让乎哉？’答曰：‘异乎吾所闻。原宪之问于孔子曰：“克伐怨欲不行焉，可以为仁乎？”孔子曰：“可以为难矣；仁，则吾不知也。”“恶不仁者，其为仁矣。”今小民不展四体，而认人之稻，不仁甚矣；而牧推而与之，又救其罪。斯为让非其义，所救非人：非所谓“恶不仁”者。苟不“恶不仁”，安得为仁哉！苍梧浇娶妻而美，让于其兄；尾生笃信，水至不去而死；直躬好直，证父攘羊；申鸣奉法，尽忠于君而执其父。忠信直让，此四行者，圣贤之所贵也。然不贵苍梧之让，非让道也；不取尾生之信，非信所也；不许直躬之直，非直体也；不嘉申鸣之忠，非忠意也。今牧犯而不校，还而不取；可以为难矣，未得为仁让也。夫圣人以德报德，以直报怨；而牧欲以德报怨，非也！必不得已，二者何从？吾从孔子也","attribution":"裴注·徐众《评》","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":397,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fa9e5a83fd1a6c56eaa6","start":11,"end":373,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-90fd87bd9f1e865386ae","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-83bc36b6bd90dbc37646","layer":"pei","quote":"童龀时号为迟讷，骃常谓人曰：‘牧必胜我，不可轻也！’时人皆以为不然","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":395,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-06a66242a29bf0eca333","start":44,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-9c66ccac7ef5015450fd","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-1017a8c1da2e3cef2cf5","layer":"pei","quote":"又揭阳县贼率曾夏等，众数千人，历十余年。以侯爵杂缯千匹，下书购募，绝不可得。牧遣使慰譬，登皆首服，自改为良民","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":424,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43dc051269e0fb8c25a0","start":41,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-a70b390b0222a5a05f5f","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-b311da2f13974b621922","layer":"original","quote":"抚夷将军高尚说牧曰〖14〗：“昔潘太常督兵五万，然后以讨五溪夷耳。是时刘氏连和，诸夷率化；今既无往日之援，而郭纯已据迁陵；而明府以三千兵深入〖15〗，尚未见其利也","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":402,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-b38d1be5759caf1402b6","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-7bdcab2ebb40d42ee681","layer":"pei","quote":"牧笑而答曰：‘卿之所言，未获我心也！马援有言：人当功多而赏薄。吾功不足录，而见宠已过当，岂以为恨！国家不深相知，而见害朝人，是以默默不敢有所陈。若其不然，当建进取之计，以报所受之恩；不徒自守而已：愤叹以此也","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-33595db1c58d43d13067","start":104,"end":207,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-b513f46a13ccef0a8f1d","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-0b46c79c4c06495fc74b","layer":"original","quote":"卒官。家无余财，士民思之","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":404,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":12,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-d048b4d19c15e291dc4f","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-7bdcab2ebb40d42ee681","layer":"pei","quote":"武安君谓秦王云：“非成业难，得贤难；非得贤难，用之难；非用之难，任之难。”武安君欲为秦王并兼六国，恐授事而不见任，故先陈此言。秦王既许而不能，卒陨将成之业，赐剑杜邮。今国家知吾，不如秦王之知武安；而害吾者，有过范雎。大皇帝时，陆丞相讨鄱阳，以二千人授吾；潘太常讨武陵，吾又有三千人。而朝廷下议，弃吾于彼；使江渚诸督，不复发兵相继。蒙国威灵自济，今日何为常！向使吾不料时度宜，苟有所陈；至见委以事，不足兵势，终有败绩之患：何“无不成”之有","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-33595db1c58d43d13067","start":244,"end":462,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-d719f492d884d7d4f8b5","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-baa8b50de45a43d8f054","layer":"original","quote":"封秦亭侯，拜越骑校尉","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":399,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":50,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-eb7e3fab9790780891a6","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-051cb6997182ebec8b89","layer":"original","quote":"汉鲁相意七世孙也〖1〗","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":383,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":13,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-f22427e5102f6740f758","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-1017a8c1da2e3cef2cf5","layer":"pei","quote":"在郡四年，以疾去职","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":424,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43dc051269e0fb8c25a0","start":160,"end":169,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-fefd05fd0bdffceab5ad","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-22a436d0e053569c8f0b","layer":"original","quote":"县长闻之，召民系狱，欲绳以法。牧为之请，长曰：“君慕承宫〖3〗，自行义事；﹝二﹞仆为民主〖4〗，当以法率下，何得寝公宪而从君邪〖5〗？”牧曰：“此是郡界，缘君意顾，故来暂住。今以少稻而杀此民〖6〗，何心复留？”遂出，装〖7〗，还山阴；长自往止之，为释系民","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":384,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":127,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-83b0080f1458980b9f24","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-67fc8774ec5679497e72","layer":"original","quote":"廷尉丁密、步兵校尉郑胄、将军钟离牧，率军讨之","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":77,"end":99,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
